      "writtenOn": "2023-01-18T15:36:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`apply_debug_policy` was written with the assumption that it failing would cause a system reboot. Now that this isn\u0027t the case, it should probably not return a `RebootReason` anymore.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 293,
        "startChar": 60,
        "endLine": 293,
        "endChar": 66
      },
      "revId": "386505d418421226f1a156abf5aa03ceed2f015d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f2941ad1_f5d6a1af",
        "filename": "pvmfw/src/entry.rs",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 294,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-18T15:36:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMO, this and the `error!` calls in `apply_debug_policy` should all be turned into `warn!` calls because they are serious errors (much more severe than `info` but don\u0027t lead to a reboot like an `error`).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 294,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 294,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "386505d418421226f1a156abf5aa03ceed2f015d",
